  "development_type": "Notifications",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal fails to comply with the terms of Article 3 of Part 1, Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended) because: \r\nThe enlarged part of the dwellinghouse would connect to a side extension, extend beyond a wall forming a side elevation of the original dwellinghouse and would have a width greater than half the width of the original dwellinghouse, contrary to Class A paragraph A.1 (j)(iii).\r\n"
